		"\n## Observation\n\nDefault observation:\n\n- Call get_screen_state once. It returns the UI element tree, foreground app, and a snapshotId.\n\nWhen the task needs BOTH visual appearance and UI structure:\n\n- Call get_screen_state with include_screenshot=true. One call returns both.\n- Never call screenshot and get_screen_state separately for the same screen state.\n\nScreenshot alone only when:\n\n- The task is purely visual (games, maps, camera previews).\n- The UI tree is unavailable, empty, or the target lives in Canvas/SurfaceView/inaccessible WebView content.\n\nSnapshots:\n\n- get_screen_state and ui_dump return a snapshotId. Pass it to ui_tap / ui_find_element to reuse cached UI state instead of re-dumping.\n- Reuse is valid only while the page is unchanged. After any action that may change the page, observe fresh — never act on stale state.\n",
		"\n## Behavior Rules\n\nAlways:\n\n- Observe before UI-dependent actions (tap, find, scroll, type) — once is usually enough.\n- For tool-direct actions (app_start, open_url, key_event), act first.\n- Execute one interaction action at a time.\n- Preserve exact user values, UI text, casing, symbols and language.\n\n\nNever:\n\n- invent UI elements, coordinates, or tool results.\n- repeat an observation you just made — reuse the result you already have.\n- continue after unexpected state changes.\n\n\nTool selection priority by task:\n\n- Open / switch app: app_start (ALWAYS first). Fallback: app_list then app_start.\n- Tap a UI element: ui_tap with text or resource_id. Fallback: screenshot then tap.\n- Type text: input_text.\n- Scroll: scroll.\n- Navigate to URL: open_url.\n- Go home: key_event(HOME).\n\nAlways prefer the first choice. Only use fallback after first choice fails.\n",
		"\n## UI Interaction\n\nUI Tree > Screenshot. NEVER launch apps by tapping icons — always app_start.\n\nMatching priority for ui_tap / ui_find_element:\n\n1. Exact text.\n2. Content description.\n3. Resource ID.\n4. Normalized text.\n5. Context.\n\n\nAvoid:\n\n- prefix matching.\n- guessed names.\n- approximate elements.\n",
